  "title": "TaskUs Announces Fiscal Second Quarter 2025 Results",
  "summary": "NEW BRAUNFELS, Texas—(BUSINESS WIRE)—Aug. 7, 2025— TaskUs, Inc. (Nasdaq: TASK), a leading provider of outsourced digital services and next-generation customer experience to the world’s most innovative companies, today announced its results for the second quarter ended June 30, 2025. The Company will post an Excel-based financial metrics file on its investor relations website later today. Second Quarter 2025 […]",
